  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "inv-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "w": 980,
      "page": "page-9",
      "text": "Invoices module, drawn from the product map you sent (RABE / Fatoora): التأهيل · الملف → 01, رمز الزكاة → 02, جارٍ → 03, فشل → 03e (إعادة returns to 02, دخول التطبيق skips to 04), تم → 03d, قاعدة الفواتير → 04, فاتورة جديدة → 05 النوع أولاً, رفع/مسح → 06, يدوي → 07, إصدار → 08 عرض الفاتورة.\nBuilt as Seaturtle's own Invoices module (the dashboard already reports to ZATCA): same shell, tokens and components, Marasy as the company, English first. The onboarding runs inside the app as a three-step wizard, once per company and then per issuing device.\nZATCA facts used: standard invoices are cleared before they are valid, simplified ones reported within 24 hours; the OTP comes from the Fatoora portal and lasts 1 hour; numbers are sequential and never reused; each invoice carries a QR code, UUID, counter and hash chain, and ships as PDF/A-3 with the signed XML.\nNot drawn yet: Arabic RTL variants, the credit-note form, the rejected-invoice fix-and-reissue flow, tablet and phone."
    }
  ],
